{"id": "13-1151-2-19", "zh": "以 m 为附加符号（anubandha）的成分，置于诸元音中最后一个元音之后，如依‘mañca rudhādīnaṃ’（5-19）而成 rundhati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-1152-2-6", "zh": "22. 规则冲突时（后者优先）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1153-2-6", "zh": "两条各有适用余地的规则同时作用于同一处时，后一条规则生效。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1153-7-27", "zh": "就像两个或三个人称同时出现时取后者一样：so ca（gacchati）tvaṃ ca（gacchasi，tumhe）gacchatha，意思是“他去、你也去，你们去”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1153-28-48", "zh": "so ca（gacchati），tvaṃ ca（gacchasi），ahaṃ ca（gacchāmi，mayaṃ）gacchāma，意思是“他去、你去、我也去，我们去”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1154-2-6", "zh": "23. 不构成组成部分的符号是附加符号。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1155-2-15", "zh": "不作为组成部分的符号，应当理解为附加符号，如依‘lupitādīnamāsimhi’（2-57）而成 kattā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1156-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“符号”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1156-5-13", "zh": "是为了不让词基等的整体成为附加符号；因为整体并不是组成部分……正是由于它具有整体的形式。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "13-1157-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“不构成组成部分”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1157-5-12", "zh": "如依‘atena’（2-108）而成 janena。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-1157-13-17", "zh": "既然仅凭这条规则就能知道附加符号要省略，所以没有另立规则来省略附加符号。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-1158-2-7", "zh": "24. 后接 vaṇṇa 一词的字母，也包括其同类音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1159-2-21", "zh": "凡后面接 vaṇṇa 一词的字母，借此也包括其同类音以及它本身的形式，如依‘yuvaṇṇānameo luttā’（1-29）而成 vākeritaṃ、samonā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-1160-2-7", "zh": "25. ntu 指与 vantu、mantu、āvantu、tavantu 相关的 ntu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1161-2-15", "zh": "只取与 vantu 等相关的 ntu，如依‘ntantūnaṃ nto yomhi paṭhame’（2-215）而成 guṇavanto。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1162-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“与 vantu 等相关”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1162-5-7", "zh": "如 jantū、tantū。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1163-2-5", "zh": "（以上是通则。）", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1164-2-8", "zh": "26. 元音在元音前省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1165-2-6", "zh": "在元音前，前面的元音应当省略。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1165-7-22", "zh": "如 tatri-me、saddhi-ndriyaṃ、nohe-taṃ、bhikkhuno-vādo、sametā-yasmā、abhibhā-yatanaṃ、puttāma-tthi、asante-ttha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1166-2-7", "zh": "27. 后一元音有时省略。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1167-2-8", "zh": "元音之后的元音有时应当省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1167-9-16", "zh": "如 so-pi、sāva、yato-dakaṃ、tato-va。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1167-17-18", "zh": "为什么说“有时”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1167-19-26", "zh": "如 saddhi-ndriyaṃ。这一管辖条目一直延续到本章结束，因此不会过度适用。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1168-2-7", "zh": "28. 两者都可以不省略。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1169-2-15", "zh": "前后两个元音有时可以都不省略，如 latā iva、late-va、latā-va。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1170-2-7", "zh": "29. 省略之后，i 类、u 类元音变为 e、o。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1171-2-11", "zh": "在元音省略之后，其后的 i 类、u 类元音可以依次变为 e、o。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1172-2-13", "zh": "如 tasse-daṃ、vāte-ritaṃ、no-peti、vāmo-rū、ate-vaññehi、vo-dakaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1172-14-21", "zh": "那么“paccorasmin”又怎么解释呢？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1172-22-23", "zh": "这是由拆分规则而来的。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-1172-24-25", "zh": "为什么说“可以”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1172-26-27", "zh": "如 tassidaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1173-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“省略之后”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1173-5-7", "zh": "如 latā iva。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1174-2-7", "zh": "30. 在元音前变为 y、v。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1175-2-9", "zh": "后接元音时，i 类、u 类元音可以依次变为 y、v。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1175-10-21", "zh": "如 byākato、iccassa、ajjhiṇamutto、svāgataṃ、svāpanalānilaṃ。为什么说“可以”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1175-22-23", "zh": "如 iti-ssa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1175-24-25", "zh": "为什么说“有时”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1175-26-29", "zh": "如 yānī-dha、sū-paṭṭhitaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1176-2-6", "zh": "31. e、o 也是如此。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1177-2-7", "zh": "后接元音时，e、o 可以依次变为 y、v。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1177-8-13", "zh": "如 tyajja（te-jja）、svāhaṃ（so-haṃ）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1177-14-15", "zh": "为什么说“有时”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1177-16-19", "zh": "如 puttāma-tthi、asante-ttha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1178-2-6", "zh": "32. go 变为 avaṅa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1179-2-6", "zh": "后接元音时，go 变为 avaṅa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1179-7-8", "zh": "如 gavā-ssaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1179-9-23", "zh": "‘yatharīva’、‘tatharive’本身就是不变词；‘bhusāmive’中的 iva 一词是 eva 的意思。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-1180-2-7", "zh": "33. 在辅音前变为长音、短音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1181-2-8", "zh": "在辅音前，短音和长音有时依次变为长音和短音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1181-9-16", "zh": "如 tatrā-yaṃ、munīcare、sammadeva、mālabhārī。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1182-2-7", "zh": "34. 元音之后重复为二。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1183-2-9", "zh": "元音之后的辅音有时变成两个，也就是重复。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1183-10-11", "zh": "如 paggaho。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1183-12-14", "zh": "为什么说“元音之后”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1183-15-17", "zh": "如 taṃ khaṇaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1184-2-7", "zh": "35. 在第四音、第二音前，这些音变为第三音、第一音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1185-2-9", "zh": "后接第四音、第二音时，这些（重复出来的）第四音、第二音变为同组的第三音、第一音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1185-10-31", "zh": "如 paccāsatthyā、nigghoso、akkhanti、bojjhaṅgā、setacchattaṃ、daḍḍho、niṭṭhānaṃ、mahaddhano、yasatthero、apphuṭaṃ、abbhuggato。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1185-32-34", "zh": "为什么说“在这些音前”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1185-35-36", "zh": "如 thero。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1185-37-39", "zh": "为什么说“这些音”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1185-40-41", "zh": "如 pattho。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1186-2-7", "zh": "36. 在 eva 前，iti 可以变为 v。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1187-2-8", "zh": "后接 eva 一词时，iti 可以变为 v。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1187-9-12", "zh": "如 itveva、icceva。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1187-13-15", "zh": "为什么说“在 eva 前”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1187-16-17", "zh": "如 iccāha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1188-2-7", "zh": "37. e、o 在字母前变为 a。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1189-2-8", "zh": "e、o 在字母前有时可以变为 a。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1189-9-30", "zh": "如 disvā yācaka māgate、akaramhasa te、esa attho、esa dhammo、aggamakkhāyati、svātanaṃ、hiyyattanaṃ、karassu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1189-31-32", "zh": "为什么说“可以”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1189-33-37", "zh": "如 yācake āgate、eso dhammo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1189-38-40", "zh": "为什么说“在字母前”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1189-41-42", "zh": "如 so。", "confidence": 85}
